      <h3 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">You Can Make A Difference On Capitol Hill</h3>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 15px;">The annual Farmers Union Fly-In is always an enjoyable time for our members in the nation's capital. It's also an important and effective way to influence policy. Members hear directly from family farmers, ranchers, and rural residents. They meet with lawmakers and face with the issues, and Farmers Union can put you at the table.</p>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 15px;">Rocky Mountain Farmers Union members participating in this fly-in will share their stories of the daily struggles they face, their hopes for future legislation that will make a difference in their lives and operations, and the key priorities of the organization.</p>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 15px;">During our time in Washington, we will hear from U.S. Department of Agriculture officials, administration officials, plus leadership staff and staff of the U.S. Senate and House of Representatives Committees on Agriculture.</p>
